    "semanticRules": [
      "`rowMutability=cas_lifecycle`",
      "唯一closed transition为expected `open → accepted|rejected`，terminal state不得转换或改写。`offer_id`与`acceptance_basis_digest`必须分别等于8.6.18从final `CandidatePackage@1`计算的`CandidateIntakeAcceptanceBasis@1`公式结果，且同事务存在唯一`ProcurementCandidateOfferAvailableMessage@1` Outbox",
      "`UNIQUE(candidate_package_id,package_digest,acceptance_basis_digest)`",
      "同一Candidate至多一个open Offer。open时全部handoff/terminal/closed列为NULL",
      "accepted CAS一次性写Decision ID、Receipt ID/digest、terminal Evidence及closed time，Decision digest沿用既有nullable合同",
      "rejected CAS一次性写全部handoff/terminal/closed列并逐项等于`LibraCandidateRejectedMessage@1`，`terminal_evidence_digest=receiptDigest`",
      "这些终态列是write-once bundle，相同Offer/相同Evidence重放返回既有终态，不得执行第二次UPDATE、改写相反Outcome或新增row/Outbox",
      "`INDEX(state,offered_at_ms)`"
    ],
    "rawContract": {
      "columns": "`offer_id PK, candidate_package_id FK, package_revision, package_digest, acceptance_basis_digest, state(open|accepted|rejected), handoff_decision_id NULL, handoff_decision_digest NULL, handoff_receipt_id NULL, handoff_receipt_digest NULL, terminal_evidence_digest NULL, offered_at_ms, closed_at_ms NULL`",
      "constraints": "`rowMutability=cas_lifecycle`；唯一closed transition为expected `open → accepted|rejected`，terminal state不得转换或改写。`offer_id`与`acceptance_basis_digest`必须分别等于8.6.18从final `CandidatePackage@1`计算的`CandidateIntakeAcceptanceBasis@1`公式结果，且同事务存在唯一`ProcurementCandidateOfferAvailableMessage@1` Outbox；`UNIQUE(candidate_package_id,package_digest,acceptance_basis_digest)`；同一Candidate至多一个open Offer。open时全部handoff/terminal/closed列为NULL；accepted CAS一次性写Decision ID、Receipt ID/digest、terminal Evidence及closed time，Decision digest沿用既有nullable合同；rejected CAS一次性写全部handoff/terminal/closed列并逐项等于`LibraCandidateRejectedMessage@1`，`terminal_evidence_digest=receiptDigest`；这些终态列是write-once bundle，相同Offer/相同Evidence重放返回既有终态，不得执行第二次UPDATE、改写相反Outcome或新增row/Outbox；`INDEX(state,offered_at_ms)`"
    },
